        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakandisisya kuntempele, weeleka minsende; bwaamba bwakali tukokola tuli musanu akamwi kulubazu lumwi, atukokola tuli musanu akamwi kulubazu lumwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi bwaamba bwamanjililo bwakali tukokola tuli ikumi, atwalo tulyango twamanjililo twakali tukokola tosanwe tosanwe kumabazu oonse ebile. Elyo wakeeleka bulamfu bwantempele, tukokola tuli makumi one, abwaamba bwayo, tukokola tuli makumi obile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakanjila mukati, weeleka minsende yamanjililo, tukokola tobile; abwalo bwaamba bwamanjililo, tukokola tuli musanu akamwi; amalambo aakumbali lyamanjililo akali tukokola tuli musanu atubili oku akooku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
