        {
          "text": "bwiime bwaco bwakali tukokola totatwe, abulamfu bwaco bwakali tukokola tobile, abwaamba bwaco bwakali tukokola tobile. Zyooko zyaco amatako aaco amalambo aaco, zyoonse zyakali zyazisamu. Lino wakandaambila kuti, Njeeyi intafule iili kubusyu bwa-Jehova. ",
